\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Updates outside the declared post-shift windows. Promotion fraction over observations \(50\)--\(699\) excluding each interval \([s,s+65)\) beginning at a true shift \(s\), averaged over 12 matched streams. The denominator is 390 observations per stream, not the number of updates. The same three methods and prices are used as in the main comparison. This operational rate is not a false-positive probability. Read with prediction risk and target occupancy before treating suppressed updates as improved adaptation. Lines show finite stream means without uncertainty bands.}}{20}{figure.7}\protected@file@percent }
